<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>XI-3 SAINTEK 1 DIGITAL — 2026/2027</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --pink-bg:#FFF6FA;
  --pink-card:#FFFFFF;
  --pink-soft:#FBD3E4;
  --pink-mid:#F186B4;
  --pink-primary:#D6336C;
  --pink-deep:#7A1943;
  --ink:#3B0A20;
  --ink-soft:#8A5169;
  --green:#1E7A34;
  --green-dark:#0F4D20;
  --gold:#C9A24B;
  --radius:18px;
  --shadow: 0 10px 30px -12px rgba(122,25,67,.25);
  --disp: 'Fraunces', serif;
  --head: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
  --body: 'Inter', sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
body{font-family:var(--body);background:var(--pink-bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;scroll-behavior:smooth;overflow-x:hidden;}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
.container{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:var(--head);font-weight:700;color:var(--pink-deep);}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--head);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pink-primary);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;display:inline-block;}
.section-title{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.2vw,2.5rem);color:var(--pink-deep);margin-bottom:6px;}
.section-sub{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:620px;margin-bottom:36px;font-size:.98rem;}
section{padding:88px 0;position:relative;}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--head);font-weight:600;font-size:.88rem;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:999px;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:.25s transform,.25s box-shadow;}
.btn-primary{background:var(--pink-primary);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px -6px rgba(214,51,108,.55);}
.btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 24px -6px rgba(214,51,108,.65);}
.btn-outline{background:transparent;border:1.5px solid var(--pink-primary);color:var(--pink-primary);}
.btn-outline:hover{background:var(--pink-primary);color:#fff;}
.btn-green{background:var(--green);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px -6px rgba(30,122,52,.5);}

/* ===== NAV ===== */
header{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:200;background:rgba(255,246,250,.86);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(214,51,108,.12);}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 24px;max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.brand-txt{line-height:1.1;}
.brand-txt b{font-family:var(--head);font-size:.92rem;color:var(--pink-deep);display:block;}
.brand-txt span{font-size:.68rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.navlinks{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;}
.navlinks a{font-family:var(--head);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--pink-deep);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;transition:.2s;}
.navlinks a:hover, .navlinks a.active{background:var(--pink-primary);color:#fff;}
.burger{display:none;background:none;border:none;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--pink-deep);cursor:pointer;}
@media(max-width:880px){
  .navlinks{position:fixed;top:64px;left:0;right:0;background:#fff;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;padding:14px;gap:4px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);transform:translateY(-130%);transition:.3s;}
  .navlinks.open{transform:translateY(0);}
  .navlinks a{text-align:center;}
  .burger{display:block;}
}

/* ===== LOGO (Ikhlas Beramal - hijau) ===== */
.ib-logo{filter:drop-shadow(0 4px 10px rgba(15,77,32,.35));}
.ib-logo.sm{width:40px;height:40px;}
.ib-logo.lg{width:150px;height:150px;}

/* ===== HERO ===== */
.hero{padding:150px 0 80px;position:relative;background:
  radial-gradient(circle at 85% 10%, rgba(241,134,180,.35), transparent 55%),
  radial-gradient(circle at 5% 90%, rgba(30,122,52,.10), transparent 45%);
}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:34px;align-items:center;}
@media(max-width:720px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center;justify-items:center;}}
.hero h1{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:clamp(2.1rem,5vw,3.4rem);line-height:1.05;color:var(--pink-deep);}
.hero .tahun{font-family:var(--head);color:var(--green-dark);font-weight:700;margin-top:6px;font-size:1rem;}
.hero p.desc{margin-top:16px;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:560px;}
.hero-cta{margin-top:26px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
@media(max-width:720px){.hero-cta{justify-content:center;}}

/* sambutan + quote */
.sambutan-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:40px;align-items:start;}
@media(max-width:820px){.sambutan-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.card{background:var(--pink-card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:28px;border:1px solid rgba(214,51,108,.08);}
.misi-list{list-style:none;margin-top:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}
.misi-list li{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink);}
.misi-list li::before{content:"✿";color:var(--pink-primary);flex:none;}

/* quote rotator */
.quote-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pink-primary),var(--pink-deep));color:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:30px 28px;position:relative;min-height:190px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;}
.quote-box .qmark{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:3rem;opacity:.4;line-height:.5;}
.quote-text{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.5;min-height:88px;}
.quote-author{margin-top:14px;font-family:var(--head);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.85;}
.quote-dots{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:16px;}
.qdot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.4);border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:0;}
.qdot.active{background:#fff;}

/* carousel foto angkatan */
.carousel{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
.carousel-track{display:flex;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1);}
.carousel-slide{min-width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:10px;padding:22px;background:#fff;}
@media(max-width:720px){.carousel-slide{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
.avatar{aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-family:var(--head);font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;text-align:center;padding:4px;}
.carousel-nav{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border:none;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;color:var(--pink-deep);font-size:1.1rem;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.12);}
.carousel-nav.prev{left:10px;}
.carousel-nav.next{right:10px;}
.carousel-dots{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:14px 0 20px;background:#fff;}
.cdot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--pink-soft);border:none;cursor:pointer;}
.cdot.active{background:var(--pink-primary);width:22px;border-radius:5px;transition:.25s;}

/* kalender acara */
.kalender{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:16px;}
.acara{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(214,51,108,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 16px;}
.acara .tgl{background:var(--pink-primary);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;font-family:var(--head);min-width:52px;}
.acara .tgl b{display:block;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1;}
.acara .tgl span{font-size:.6rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;}
.acara .info b{display:block;font-family:var(--head);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--pink-deep);}
.acara .info span{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}

/* ===== TABS ===== */
.tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(214,51,108,.12);}
.tab-btn{font-family:var(--head);font-weight:600;font-size:.86rem;padding:11px 18px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink-soft);position:relative;top:2px;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;}
.tab-btn.active{color:var(--pink-primary);border-bottom-color:var(--pink-primary);}
.tab-panel{display:none;animation:fade .35s ease;}
.tab-panel.active{display:block;}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

/* ===== TREE VIEW (struktur pengurus) ===== */
.tree{list-style:none;}
.tree li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;margin:4px 0;}
.tree > li{padding-left:0;}
.tree ul{list-style:none;margin-top:6px;padding-left:20px;border-left:2px dashed var(--pink-soft);}
.tree-node{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(214,51,108,.12);border-radius:12px;padding:9px 14px;font-size:.87rem;box-shadow:0 3px 10px -4px rgba(122,25,67,.15);}
.tree-node b{font-family:var(--head);color:var(--pink-deep);font-size:.86rem;}
.tree-node span{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.74rem;}
.tree-toggle{background:var(--pink-primary);color:#fff;border:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;font-size:.75rem;cursor:pointer;flex:none;}
.tree-children{overflow:hidden;max-height:0;transition:max-height .35s ease;}
.tree-children.open{max-height:600px;}

/* ===== ACCORDION (jadwal mingguan) ===== */
.accordion-item{border:1px solid rgba(214,51,108,.14);border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;}
.accordion-head{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:15px 18px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--head);font-weight:600;color:var(--pink-deep);font-size:.92rem;}
.accordion-head .plus{transition:.3s transform;color:var(--pink-primary);}
.accordion-item.open .plus{transform:rotate(45deg);}
.accordion-body{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .35s ease;}
.accordion-item.open .accordion-body{max-height:300px;}
.accordion-body-in{padding:0 18px 16px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
.pill{background:var(--pink-bg);border:1px solid var(--pink-soft);color:var(--pink-deep);font-size:.78rem;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-family:var(--head);font-weight:500;}

/* ===== GURU grid + POPOVER ===== */
.guru-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:8px;}
.guru-card{position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(214,51,108,.12);border-radius:14px;padding:14px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;transition:.2s;}
.guru-card:hover{border-color:var(--pink-primary);}
.guru-icon{font-size:1.5rem;background:var(--pink-bg);width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;}
.guru-mini b{display:block;font-family:var(--head);font-size:.83rem;color:var(--pink-deep);}
.guru-mini span{font-size:.74rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.popover{position:absolute;z-index:20;bottom:calc(100% + 10px);left:0;width:230px;background:var(--pink-deep);color:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;font-size:.78rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(6px);transition:.2s;}
.popover.show{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translateY(0);}
.popover:after{content:"";position:absolute;top:100%;left:24px;border:7px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--pink-deep);}
.popover b{display:block;font-family:var(--head);margin-bottom:4px;font-size:.82rem;}
.popover .k{display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.68rem;}

/* ===== PAGINATION (daftar siswa) ===== */
.murid-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;min-height:210px;}
.murid-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(214,51,108,.1);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 10px;text-align:center;}
.murid-card .av{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto 8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-family:var(--head);font-weight:700;font-size:.8rem;}
.murid-card b{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--pink-deep);font-family:var(--head);display:block;}
.pagination{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:6px;margin-top:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.page-btn{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--pink-soft);background:#fff;color:var(--pink-deep);font-family:var(--head);font-size:.8rem;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;}
.page-btn.active{background:var(--pink-primary);color:#fff;border-color:var(--pink-primary);}
.page-btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed;}

/* ===== visi/struktur cards ===== */
.grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;}
@media(max-width:760px){.grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

/* ===== Mading gallery ===== */
.mading-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:18px;}
.mading-card{border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
.mading-photo{height:150px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.4rem;color:#fff;}
.mading-info{padding:14px;}
.mading-info b{font-family:var(--head);color:var(--pink-deep);font-size:.88rem;}
.mading-info span{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.76rem;}

/* ===== Prestasi + rating ===== */
.prestasi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:18px;}
.prestasi-card{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:18px;}
.prestasi-icon{font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:10px;}
.prestasi-card h4{font-size:.98rem;margin-bottom:4px;}
.prestasi-card p{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:12px;}
.rating{display:flex;gap:4px;}
.star{font-size:1.2rem;cursor:pointer;color:var(--pink-soft);background:none;border:none;transition:.15s;}
.star.on{color:var(--gold);}
.rating-label{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-left:6px;}

/* ===== curhat / kontak ===== */
.form-grid{display:grid;gap:12px;}
input,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--pink-soft);font-family:var(--body);font-size:.88rem;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);}
textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:100px;}
input:focus,textarea:focus{outline:2px solid var(--pink-primary);outline-offset:1px;}
.two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:36px;}
@media(max-width:820px){.two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.spotify-box{background:var(--green);color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;}
.spotify-box .ic{font-size:1.8rem;}
.spotify-box b{font-family:var(--head);font-size:.85rem;display:block;}
.spotify-box span{font-size:.76rem;opacity:.85;}
.wa-float{position:fixed;bottom:22px;right:22px;background:#25D366;color:#fff;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.5rem;box-shadow:0 10px 22px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.35);z-index:150;}
.toast{position:fixed;bottom:24px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(120%);background:var(--pink-deep);color:#fff;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-family:var(--head);font-size:.85rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow);transition:.35s;z-index:300;}
.toast.show{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);}

footer{background:var(--pink-deep);color:#fce8f1;padding:44px 0 26px;margin-top:40px;}
.footer-grid{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:center;}
footer small{opacity:.7;font-size:.76rem;}

::selection{background:var(--pink-mid);color:#fff;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===== NAV ===== -->
<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="brand">
      <svg class="ib-logo sm" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><use href="#ib-emblem"/></svg>
      <div class="brand-txt"><b>XI-3 SAINTEK 1</b><span>Digital · 2026/2027</span></div>
    </div>
    <nav class="navlinks" id="navlinks">
      <a href="#beranda" class="active">Beranda</a>
      <a href="#profil">Profil</a>
      <a href="#akademik">Akademik</a>
      <a href="#mading">Mading</a>
      <a href="#prestasi">Prestasi & Karya</a>
      <a href="#curhat">Sudut Curhat</a>
      <a href="#kontak">Kontak</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="burger" id="burger">☰</button>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- SVG symbol pool (reused emblem) -->
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
  <symbol id="ib-emblem" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
    <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="48" fill="#1E7A34"/>
    <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="48" fill="none" stroke="#C9A24B" stroke-width="2"/>
    <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 3" opacity=".6"/>
    <g stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".85">
      <line x1="50" y1="6" x2="50" y2="14"/><line x1="50" y1="86" x2="50" y2="94"/>
      <line x1="6" y1="50" x2="14" y2="50"/><line x1="86" y1="50" x2="94" y2="50"/>
      <line x1="18" y1="18" x2="24" y2="24"/><line x1="76" y1="76" x2="82" y2="82"/>
      <line x1="82" y1="18" x2="76" y2="24"/><line x1="24" y1="76" x2="18" y2="82"/>
    </g>
    <polygon points="50,26 55,42 72,42 58,52 63,68 50,58 37,68 42,52 28,42 45,42" fill="#F4D160"/>
    <path d="M30 58 Q50 46 70 58 L70 66 Q50 56 30 66 Z" fill="#ffffff"/>
    <line x1="50" y1="48" x2="50" y2="65" stroke="#1E7A34" stroke-width="1.2"/>
  </symbol>
</svg>

<!-- ===== BERANDA ===== -->
<section id="beranda" class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <svg class="ib-logo lg" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><use href="#ib-emblem"/></svg>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Ikhlas Beramal · Kelas Digital</span>
        <h1>XI‑3 Saintek 1<br>Digital</h1>
        <div class="tahun">Tahun Ajaran 2026 / 2027</div>
        <p class="desc">Website resmi kelas XI‑3 Saintek 1 Digital — tempat berbagi jadwal, karya, dokumentasi kegiatan, dan cerita satu tahun bersama 36 murid dan wali kelas tercinta.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="#profil" class="btn btn-primary">Lihat Profil Kelas</a>
          <a href="#akademik" class="btn btn-outline">Jadwal Pelajaran</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sambutan-wrap">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="eyebrow">Sambutan Wali Kelas</span>
        <h3 style="margin-bottom:10px;">Selamat datang di rumah kedua kalian 🌸</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.92rem;">
          "Selamat datang di kelas XI‑3 Saintek 1 Digital. Ibu berharap kelas ini menjadi ruang belajar yang hangat, jujur, dan penuh semangat berbagi — tempat kalian tumbuh bukan hanya secara akademik, tapi juga secara karakter. Mari isi tahun ini dengan ikhlas beramal: belajar dengan sungguh‑sungguh, saling membantu, dan menjaga kekompakan."
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px;font-family:var(--head);font-weight:600;color:var(--pink-deep);font-size:.85rem;">— Ibu Try Ade Jumita Wulandari, M.Pd.Gr, Wali Kelas</p>
        <h4 style="margin-top:22px;font-size:1rem;">Misi Kelas</h4>
        <ul class="misi-list">
          <li>Membangun budaya belajar aktif dan kolaboratif di setiap mata pelajaran.</li>
          <li>Menjaga kekompakan dan rasa saling peduli antar anggota kelas.</li>
          <li>Mendokumentasikan setiap momen dan karya sebagai jejak perjalanan kelas.</li>
          <li>Menjadi kelas yang ikhlas beramal — berkontribusi tanpa pamrih untuk sekolah.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="quote-box">
          <span class="qmark">"</span>
          <div class="quote-text" id="quoteText"></div>
          <div class="quote-author" id="quoteAuthor"></div>
          <div class="quote-dots" id="quoteDots"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
          <span class="eyebrow">Kalender Acara</span>
          <div class="kalender">
            <div class="acara"><div class="tgl"><b>17</b><span>Agu</span></div><div class="info"><b>Upacara HUT RI</b><span>Lapangan sekolah · 07.00</span></div></div>
            <div class="acara"><div class="tgl"><b>02</b><span>Sep</span></div><div class="info"><b>Studi Tur Angkatan</b><span>Berangkat pagi bersama</span></div></div>
            <div class="acara"><div class="tgl"><b>10</b><span>Okt</span></div><div class="info"><b>Ujian Tengah Semester</b><span>Minggu ujian, jaga kesehatan!</span></div></div>
